Subject: [PATCH] Replace one-off patch workflow with approval-gated Z240
 deployment

- Run the API as a Scheduled Task so it outlives the runner job
- Deploy to versioned release folders with health check and automatic rollback
- Refuse to stop foreign processes listening on the API port
- Manual (workflow_dispatch) trigger on a protected environment, read-only token
- Remove one-off patch workflow, patch file and stray Patchs file
- Document setup, Data Protection key path and manual rollback
